y theyâ€™ve been saddled with higher workloads while facing the threat of job loss caused by the very products theyâ€™re building. Workers from Google DeepMind and Meta in the UK are also objecting to how their companiesâ€™ AI products are being used, such as for <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/may/04/google-deepmind-uk-workers-union">military purposes</a> or to <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/may/19/meta-jobs-ai-transfers">monitor employee productivity</a>. Those same workers are now attempting to unionize.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/technology/2026/jul/21/ai-tech-workers-unionize">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;yUvEbJ1S1XjEP4iNNNvr3rpfysl1x4fdbKu3GOhTpcwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;w-33kJbaQWmNYpyErBUixfzfgvvFOVhzq_BBy32Q9RAƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;TWca7bdGgde3QjzkXk_mIEhgAF7qvmXhBuPlCru2o24ƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;25XTjVT6Kep7i9uUoeWI3NLazOIc1YaOROD1ZXP_Dfsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Pd4O5pHWzTlRDgOV8flNNQnl2zcmLoN8D0rkMUOH1MMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;rX81W2ssH6nvFleF-xyIRLS2UAstxMV6u7-pAxcBDfEƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zuIzpfkFfv_UX6WsBlbrt1NP97mEzN42QZh5ND2WlLsƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdTextƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;FKlGY_apYfJY_XQqOuDLHI33oKcyreFZeT51UoAsYW8ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdu